{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"Signature Stripping Attack - Tag | ꜱᴘᴀᴡɴ𝟐ᴘᴡɴ","description":"Personal CTF writeups and cybersecurity notes.","home_page_url":"https://ctf.spawn2pwn.my.id/","language":"en","icon":"https://ctf.spawn2pwn.my.id/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://ctf.spawn2pwn.my.id/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"spawn2pwn","url":"https://github.com/nfl-alvis","avatar":"https://ctf.spawn2pwn.my.id/images/IdaWin.png"}],"items":[{"title":"TryHeartMe","date_published":"2026-10-19T00:00:00&#43;07:00","date_modified":"2026-10-19T10:44:26&#43;07:00","id":"https://ctf.spawn2pwn.my.id/posts/tryheartme/","url":"https://ctf.spawn2pwn.my.id/posts/tryheartme/","authors":[{"name":"spawn2pwn","url":"https://github.com/nfl-alvis","avatar":"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b01c9af4b33ead25b072a03f8d0c5508?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["JWT","Signature Stripping Attack"],"summary":" Access the hidden item in this Valentine\u0026rsquo;s gift shop.\nTL;DR TryHeartMe is an easy TryHackMe web challenge that demonstrates a JWT signature-stripping vulnerability. By modifying the JWT payload to change the role claim from user to admin and removing the signature, it is possible to escalate privileges, gain access to the admin dashboard, and purchase the hidden ValenFlag item. Scenario The challenge description provides us with the following message:\n","content_html":"\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/posts/tryheartme/images/room_image.webp\" title=\"/posts/tryheartme/images/room_image.webp\" data-thumbnail=\"/posts/tryheartme/images/room_image.webp\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e/posts/tryheartme/images/room_image.webp\u003c/h2\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg loading=\"lazy\" src='/posts/tryheartme/images/room_image.webp' alt=\"/posts/tryheartme/images/room_image.webp\" height=\"256\" width=\"256\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAccess the hidden item in this Valentine\u0026rsquo;s gift shop.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"details admonition abstract open\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"details-summary admonition-title\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"icon fa-solid fa-clipboard-list\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003eTL;DR\u003ci class=\"details-icon fa-solid fa-angle-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"details-content\"\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"admonition-content\"\u003eTryHeartMe is an easy TryHackMe web challenge that demonstrates a JWT signature-stripping vulnerability. By modifying the JWT payload to change the \u003ccode\u003erole\u003c/code\u003e claim from \u003ccode\u003euser\u003c/code\u003e to \u003ccode\u003eadmin\u003c/code\u003e and removing the signature, it is possible to escalate privileges, gain access to the admin dashboard, and purchase the hidden ValenFlag item.\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"heading-element\" id=\"scenario\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eScenario\u003c/span\u003e\n  \u003ca href=\"#scenario\" class=\"heading-mark\"\u003e\n    \u003csvg class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\n  \u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe challenge description provides us with the following message:\u003c/p\u003e"}]}